<title>USA: Ceridian acquires software, contracts.</title>
<headline>Ceridian acquires software, contracts.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ceridian Corp said Thursday it acquired technical engineering and maintenance systems software and certain related contracts from PRC Aviation LLC.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The software, contracts and principal software developer are now part of Computing Devices International, Ceridian's business that provides electronic systems, subsystems and systems integration services to government and commercial clients.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
